 Sales (days)","metric_code":"DEBTORS_SALES_DAYS","description":"Average days to collect receivables; higher = cash flow delays.","bucket":"Other","normal_range":"<90 days (lower = better)","industry_median":7.5,"formula":"(Debtors ÷ Sales) × 365","category":"decimal","threshold_redflag_sign":">","threshold_1":90.0,"threshold_2":120.0,"2021":"27.8301","2022":"409.8727","2023":"906.2065","2024":"2926.7285","2025":"7536.8647","2026":"-"},{"metric":"Depreciation Index","metric_code":"DEPRECIATION_INDEX","description":"Compares a company's depreciation expense in the current year to its depreciation expense in the previous year.; sudden change = risk accounting.","bucket":"Other","normal_range":"Industry dependent","industry_median":7.5,"formula":"(Depreciation[t-1]/(PP&E[t-1] + Depreciation[t-1])) / (Depreciation[t]/(PP&E[t] + Depreciation[t]))","category":"decimal","threshold_redflag_sign":"-","threshold_1":null,"threshold_2":null,"2021":"0.0418","2022":"0.8886","2023":"0.7202","2024":"0.8861","2025":"-","2026":"-"},{"metric":"Dividend Proposed","metric_code":"DIVIDEND_PROPOSED","description":"Proposed dividend payout; higher = good for shareholders, reduces retained earnings.","bucket":"Other","normal_range":"Positive if declared","industry_median":7.5,"formula":"Dividend per share","category":"decimal","threshold_redflag_sign":"-","threshold_1":null,"threshold_2":null,"2021":"1.5155","2022":"1.6097","2023":"1.9205","2024":"1.6889","2025":"1.1944","2026":"-"},{"metric":"Dooms Day Ratio","metric_code":"DOOMSDAY_RATIO","description":"Measures liquidity safety; lower ratio = higher default risk.","bucket":"Liquidity","normal_range":">1 healthy","industry_median":7.5,"formula":"(Cash) ÷ Total Liabilities","category":"decimal","threshold_redflag_sign":"<","threshold_1":0.2,"threshold_2":0.05,"2021":"0.0068","2022":"0.0085","2023":"0.1573","2024":"0.0098","2025":"0.0165","2026":"-"},{"metric":"EBIT Margin","metric_code":"OPERATING_PROFIT_MARGIN_ROS_PERCENT","description":"